{"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"metadata":{"role":"collection","externalID":"TracingDestinations","modules":[{"name":"TracingDestinations"}],"title":"TracingDestinations","roleHeading":"Framework","symbolKind":"module"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations"},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"title":"Destinations","anchor":"Destinations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations\/SpanEventDestination"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations\/SpanEventDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" finds each record’s span from the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"type":"text","text":" the event was tracked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in, so a delivery that runs later, under another span or none, still adds the event to the right"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. Each span event is named after the event, stamped with the time it was tracked, and carries"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the event’s description under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event"},{"type":"text","text":" and its call site under OpenTelemetry’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"code.*"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"names."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Span events can’t be added to a span that has ended. A record tracked outside any span, or whose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"span ended before its batch was delivered, is left out. Batch tightly enough for your spans to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"outlive their batches, and deliver to another destination as well for the events that must not be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lost. To write events to your logs instead, use ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoggerDestination"},{"text":" in the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoggingDestinations"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"module.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: SpanEventDestination(tracer: tracer))","let span = tracer.startSpan(\"checkout\")","ServiceContext.withValue(span.context) {","    tracker.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","}","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()","span.end()"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The umbrella guide on this area is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/tracingdestinations"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A destination that adds each tracked event to the span that was active when it was tracked.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://TracingDestinations/documentation/TracingDestinations/SpanEventDestination":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SpanEventDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations\/SpanEventDestination","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SpanEventDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/tracingdestinations\/spaneventdestination","type":"topic","title":"SpanEventDestination","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that adds each event to the span that was active when the event was tracked."}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://TracingDestinations/documentation/TracingDestinations":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/tracingdestinations","role":"collection","title":"TracingDestinations","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that adds each tracked event to the span that was active when it was tracked."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations"},"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/traffluent/choosingdestinations":{"url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","type":"link","title":"Choosing Destinations","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Choosing Destinations","type":"text"}]}}}